{"id": "70124", "title": "重生", "author": "洛夜", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70124/70124s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70124.htm", "intro": "简单地说，这篇文就是一个曾经依靠潜规则大红大紫的男人，再次依靠潜规则大红大紫的故事……\n    苏慕彦在自己获得影帝头衔的两个月后遭遇莫名枪击身亡，醒来后却发现自己重生成了娱乐圈中有名的邵家二少爷，前一世中爱人的弟弟。\n    杀害自己的凶手、前世情人的背弃、未来大嫂的咄咄逼人、娱乐女皇的爱子情深、黑道表哥的纠缠戏弄……和再一次地成为天皇巨星。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70124", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10845136.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10845137.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10845138.html", "available": true}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10845139.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10845140.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10845141.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10845576.html", "available": true}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10845577.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10845578.html", "available": true}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10845579.html", "available": true}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10845580.html", "available": true}]}